RUN: /usr/bin/test/terminal-vt.exe
CHECK: terminal-vt: config defaults, validation, themes and font geometry pass
CHECK: terminal-vt: configured fonts and colors preserve incremental rendering and cursor shapes
CHECK: terminal-vt: blank cells use default colors and erases preserve the active background
CHECK: terminal-vt: basic controls ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: UTF-8 ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: CSI ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: unsupported CSI stays invisible across split reads
CHECK: terminal-vt: delayed right-margin wrap preserves tmux peers ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: tmux resize cursor, erase and scroll controls ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: attributes ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: resize ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: scrollback and tabs ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: titles and RGB ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: DEC modes ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: cursor styles and blink modes preserve cells across split reads
CHECK: terminal-vt: charset designation ok
CHECK: terminal-vt: incremental pixels match full rendering and resize failures preserve state
CHECK: terminal-vt: cursor shapes blink on bounded deadlines and preserve incremental pixels
